Local commit feb34333de updates Happy DOM to 21.0.4, Tailwind CSS and its PostCSS integration to 4.3.5, Bun type definitions to 1.4.5 and dotenv to 18.0.10. Only the dependency manifest, lockfile and Knope change file changed. Bun audit no longer reports the Happy DOM advisories. The separate minimatch fix is EVO-104 and the Effect compatibility review is EVO-105.

Frozen install, Knope, lint, formatting, 4,457 unit tests, 387 PostgreSQL tests, Terraform and the Linux image build and security scan passed. Full functional and documentation browser verification is running before publication.' --json`,yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1100});text(r);

const r=await tools.mcp__codex_apps__linear_save_comment({issueId:"EVO-103",body:"First review: five dependency changes and the Knope file are in local commit `feb34333de`. Frozen install, formatting, lint, 4,457 unit tests on Node 24.22.1, 387 PostgreSQL tests, Terraform and the Linux runtime image scan passed. The full 280-case functional and documentation baseline is running on a disposable stack. [Entire Trail 40](https://entire.com/gh/evorto-app/-/trails/40)

Happy DOM 21.0.4 clears both high-severity findings in Bun's audit. The audit could not query the Font Awesome registry. The remaining moderate minimatch advisory is tracked in EVO-104, with an ESLint and typescript-eslint update path confirmed from registry metadata. Effect 4.1.5 needs a SQL cancellation patch review and is tracked in EVO-105.

Leave TypeScript 7 pending Angular support (Angular 22.3 still declares `>=6.0 <6.1`), and hold PostgreSQL 18 until the version-17 tooling and persistent-volume migration are planned. Node 26 is supported by Angular but the open proposal only changes the Docker pin; review the separate CI/runtime pins together. Stripe 23 introduces a new API version and needs a payment/webhook compatibility review. Existing Dependabot PRs remain in their own scope. The Vitest PR CI failed at the missing `FONT_AWESOME_TOKEN` preflight, before test execution."});text(r);

